# The skill file is embedded into the binary with include_str! and written to
# the agent's skills directory verbatim. A CRLF checkout on Windows would ship
# CRLF frontmatter to an agent that expects "---\n", so pin it to LF wherever
# it is checked out. (render() also normalizes, in case a build happens outside
# a git checkout with these attributes.)
skill/SKILL.md text eol=lf
